{"id": "EUVD-2026-54209", "enisaUuid": "ce879cf1-5c33-319e-9ff5-99a1521ad2e3", "description": "The System REST API accepts user-supplied file uploads without enforcing sufficient validation on the file type or destination, allowing files to be written to arbitrary server-accessible locations. Exploitation requires authenticated administrative access with publisher privileges.\n\nSuccessful exploitation permits an authenticated publisher to upload files to server-accessible locations. Depending on the deployment environment and how uploaded files are handled, this could lead to the execution of uploaded content, potentially resulting in remote code execution.", "datePublished": "2026-08-06T17:32:14", "dateUpdated": "2026-09-23T15:30:30", "baseScore": 9.1, "baseScoreVersion": "3.1", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:H/UI:N/S:C/C:H/I:H/A:H", "references": ["https://security.docs.wso2.com/en/latest/security-announcements/security-advisories/2026/WSO2-2026-5146/"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-3418", "GHSA-xx79-g5wr-vq89"], "assigner": "WSO2", "epss": 0.76, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "1e0cda0d-5a48-37ef-97c8-db665fcf0fc3", "product": {"name": "WSO2 API Control Plane", "vendor": {"name": "WSO2"}}, "product_version": "4.5.0 <4.5.0.53"}, {"id": "31c756fc-9850-36fb-98a8-1f5d1a8d62bf", "product": {"name": "WSO2 Carbon API Management Implementation", "vendor": {"name": "WSO2"}}, "product_version": "9.32.147 <9.32.147.44"}, {"id": "3ffaf41f-50f5-373c-a0ce-e476591117bc", "product": {"name": "WSO2 Universal Gateway", "vendor": {"name": "WSO2"}}, "product_version": "4.6.0 <4.6.0.16"}, {"id": "462aa515-7fc1-3ff9-aa0c-4a5b6e2e53c7", "product": {"name": "WSO2 Universal Gateway", "vendor": {"name": "WSO2"}}, "product_version": "4.5.0 <4.5.0.52"}, {"id": "5dd3e380-ff3f-3408-9640-19e66ccbfaa4", "product": {"name": "WSO2 Traffic Manager", "vendor": {"name": "WSO2"}}, "product_version": "4.5.0 <4.5.0.51"}, {"id": "6be611e1-3d79-3d17-a413-261345759fcf", "product": {"name": "WSO2 API Manage